    "description": {
      "value": "\n\n\n<p>As an enemy strikes at you, the power of your mark strikes back - lightning arcs into the target. You deal electricity damage equal to 1d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>\n"
